4e9eba054171,within_group,SouthernAfrica,san,Ego,grandchildren,kin_role,kin_role,joking_relationship,symmetric,,,"/san_marshall_208_sv:p::/san_marshall_208_sv::Only among ego's lineal kin in the generation of great-grandparents, grandparents, grandchildren, great-grandchildren is the joking relation established by the generational method. || /san_marshall_20_1957_sv:p::/san_marshall_20_1957_sv::Ego has the joking relationship with grandparents and grandchildren unless the factor of the name places ego terminologically in the other, non-joking, division.",0.875,0.9,2,2,/san_marshall_208_sv:p; /san_marshall_20_1957_sv:p,1198;1204
