03c6b6f11335,within_group,WesternAfrica,Hausa,husband,his joking relations,person,group,joking_relationship,unclear,,,"/Hausa_Baba_138_NK:p::/Hausa_Baba_138_NK::Then at the seventh month, or earlier, the husband begins to cut down wood in the bush and collect it, he and his younger brother and his joking relations.",0.6,0.6,1,1,/Hausa_Baba_138_NK:p,598
