4e1aa2e06810,within_group,WesternAfrica,Hausa,parents,their youngest child,kin_role,kin_role,joking_relationship,symmetric,joking,,"/Hausa_Greenberg_204_NK:p::/Hausa_Greenberg_204_NK::The other joking relationships between individuals are between grandparents and grandchildren, between parents and their youngest child (who in this as in other respects is assimilated to a grandchild), ...",0.85,0.85,1,1,/Hausa_Greenberg_204_NK:p,639
